msgctxt "63\t142"
msgid "Looks like I'm heading out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "143\t222"
msgid "Going to see Kashiwagi-san, I assume?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "223\t283"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "398\t478"
msgid "So? How does it look out there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "498\t692"
msgid ""
"Well the cops quit hanging around the club...\\n"
"but now they're swarming the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "693\t742"
msgid "That's a problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "743\t844"
msgid "Guess I'll need a way around them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "845\t926"
msgid ""
"Already have you covered,\\n"
"though it's kinda a pain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "927\t1122"
msgid ""
"First head east toward Nakamichi Street, cross that\\n"
"toward Pink Street, but head up before you reach it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1123\t1241"
msgid ""
"That'll get you into the Millennium Tower\\n"
"without the cops ever even noticing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1250\t1310"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312\t1517"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san. Cops aside, there have been\\n"
"some shady characters around town lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520\t1582"
msgid "I suggest you stay on your guard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1587\t1644"
msgid "What do they look like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1645\t1750"
msgid "Men in black suits sporting black sunglasses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1761\t1947"
msgid ""
"I hear they're foreigners...\\n"
"Attempting to track down Daigo Dojima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1949\t1987"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1988\t2167"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure of the specifics, but it may have\\n"
"something to do with why Daigo-san was shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2186\t2336"
msgid ""
"Someone has really been pulling out\\n"
"all the stops to find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2391\t2477"
msgid "Probably to see if he's still alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2499\t2663"
msgid ""
"I don't really want to entertain this thought,\\n"
"but if Daigo-san truly is gone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2664\t2807"
msgid ""
"Anyone with hopes of becoming the next chairman\\n"
"would be met with some very welcome news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2827\t3012"
msgid ""
"In any case, they're no friends of yours,\\n"
"Kiryu-san. Keep your guard up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3029\t3107"
msgid "I will. Thanks."
msgstr ""